              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "24",
                "text": "Development of Scheduled Castes and Scheduled Tribes."
              },
              {
                "type": "note",
                "text": "NOTE : The Ministry of Welfare will be the nodal Ministry for overall policy, planning and coordination or programmes of development for Scheduled Castes and Scheduled Tribes. In regard to sectoral programmes and schemes of development of these communities policy, planning. monitoring, evaluation ctc. as also their coordination will be the responsibility of the concerned Central Ministries, State Governments and Union Territory Adminstrations. Each Central Ministry and Department will be the nodal Ministry or Department concerning its sector."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
